      "side": 1,
      "message": "It does *for that specific file*, but the opposite option is worse: one wouldn\u0027t be able to protect such files at all, probably killing Incremental as a feature at the moment when Android Security starts requiring verification on reads\nAll such files are expected to be mostly Play metadata and small. Play signs APKs, and those are the only big files that we care about while streaming",
